# Load order is dependency order. Core first (palette, config, registries),
# then one file per feature, then the two shared surfaces those features
# register into. Teleports.lua comes before the two features that offer a
# teleport button; nothing else here depends on anything but Core.
Core.lua
Timer.lua
GuildKeys.lua
Keystone.lua
Teleports.lua
JoinPopup.lua
Chat.lua
Bloodlust.lua
Options.lua
